 "name_en": "Credit Memo Processing (1EZ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Credit Memo Processing (1EZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A credit memo request is created with the amount to be credited and placed on a billing block for review. It is then released to become billing relevant and appear on the billing due list. The periodic billing process creates a credit memo to be sent to the customer and posts a journal entry.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo request</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve workflow for credit memo requests</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Remove billing block (review credit memo request)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate credit memo processing in the system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>贷项凭证处理 (1EZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">创建含待贷记金额的贷项凭证请求，并置于开票冻结中以供检查。然后将其发布以与开票相关并显示在开票到期清单中。定期开票流程会创建一份发送至客户的贷项凭证，并过账日记账分录。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证请求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批贷项凭证请求的工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">移除开票冻结（检查贷项凭证请求）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioca1b851bf08c43478691358373de0add__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在系统中集成贷项凭证处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
